# 10. Count Bit Flips

Steps:

1. XOR the two numbers.
2. Count set bits in the XOR result.

```java
int xor = a ^ b;
int count = 0;

while(xor != 0) {
    xor = xor & (xor - 1);
    count++;
}

return count;
```

